algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm EquicurvatureFeasibility(g, n, alpha_min, degrees):
  target <- 2*pi*(2 - 2*g) / n
  feasible <- true
  for each v with degree d(v):
    upper_bound <- 2*pi - d(v) * alpha_min
    if target > upper_bound:
      feasible <- false
      report obstruction at v
  return (feasible, obstructions)

Complexity: O(n) time.
